# Personal / PII pattern list used by .githooks/pre-commit.
#
# Copy this file to $(git rev-parse --git-dir)/pii-patterns.local — that
# location is OUTSIDE the working tree and never committed. Add regex
# patterns (grep -E, case-insensitive) that describe names, emails, org
# handles, or internal codenames YOU want to keep out of commits.
#
# Format:
#   • One pattern per line.
#   • Blank lines and lines starting with '#' are ignored.
#   • Use \b for word boundaries so "matt" doesn't also flag "matters".
#
# Example (uncomment + edit for your context):
#
# \byour-employer\b
# \byour\.last\.name\b
# \byour-first-name\b
# @your-employer\.com
# your-internal-codename
